# NOTE: torch + transformers were removed here. They were only ever imported by
# dj/apps/search/transform.py, a module with no callers that also imported
# `langchain` (never in this file), so it raised ModuleNotFoundError on import
# and was dead. Real embeddings come from the OpenAI API
# (dj/apps/search/helpers.py + drf_filters.py, text-embedding-3-small).
# Dropping them also drops numpy: `transformers` was the ONLY non-extra
# numpy requirer in this file, and pgvector 0.5.0 is numpy-optional (it only
# touches numpy via `sys.modules.get('numpy')`). Deliberately NOT adding a
# numpy pin -- there is no numpy left to drift. Anything that needs numpy must
# add it here explicitly, pinned.
webauthn==3.0.1
